{"seq":1,"slug":"agent-fundamentals","title":"Agent 核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/agent-patterns/agent-fundamentals","wordCount":1596,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"agent-核心概念\">Agent 核心概念</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>早期的 AI 编程工具（如代码补全和简单的聊天问答）只能在单轮交互中提供建议，无法自主完成多步骤的复杂任务。当开发者需要&quot;重构整个模块&quot;或&quot;排查并修复一个跨文件的 Bug&quot;时，这些工具显得力不从心。我们需要一种能够自主规划、使用工具、持续迭代的智能体架构——这就是 AI Agent。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Traditional AI Tool&#10;        direction LR&#10;        U1[&quot;User Input&quot;] --&gt; M1[&quot;Model Generation&quot;] --&gt; O1[&quot;Return Result&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph AI Agent&#10;        direction LR&#10;        U2[&quot;User Input&quot;] --&gt; P[&quot;Planning&quot;] --&gt; A[&quot;Execute Action&quot;] --&gt; OB[&quot;Observe Result&quot;]&#10;        OB --&gt;|&quot;Not done&quot;| P&#10;        OB --&gt;|&quot;Done&quot;| O2[&quot;Return Result&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Traditional AI Tool\n        direction LR\n        U1[\"User Input\"] --&gt; M1[\"Model Generation\"] --&gt; O1[\"Return Result\"]\n    end\n    subgraph AI Agent\n        direction LR\n        U2[\"User Input\"] --&gt; P[\"Planning\"] --&gt; A[\"Execute Action\"] --&gt; OB[\"Observe Result\"]\n        OB --&gt;|\"Not done\"| P\n        OB --&gt;|\"Done\"| O2[\"Return Result\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AI Agent 可以概括为一个以 LLM 为推理引擎的自主循环：理解意图 → 规划步骤 → 调用工具 → 观察结果 → 继续迭代，直到任务完成。它的能力由三个要素共同决定——**大脑（Brain）**负责推理与规划，**工具（Tools）**负责与文件、终端、搜索等外部世界交互，**记忆（Memory）**负责维持跨步骤的上下文与状态。判断一个系统是否属于 Agent，关键看两点：是否能在无人逐步指挥的情况下自主分解任务，是否能通过工具获得并利用真实环境的反馈。这也正是它与 Chatbot（只做问答）、Copilot（只做跟随式补全）的本质分界。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"模式定义\">模式定义</h2><p>AI Agent 是一个以大语言模型（LLM）为核心推理引擎，具备工具调用能力和状态记忆能力，能够自主规划并执行多步任务的智能系统。Agent 的核心由三大要素构成：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    AGENT[&quot;AI Agent&quot;]&#10;    AGENT --&gt; BRAIN[&quot;🧠 Brain&lt;br/&gt;LLM Reasoning Engine&quot;]&#10;    AGENT --&gt; TOOLS[&quot;🔧 Tools&lt;br/&gt;Interact with External World&quot;]&#10;    AGENT --&gt; MEMORY[&quot;💾 Memory&lt;br/&gt;Context &amp; State&quot;]&#10;&#10;    BRAIN --&gt; B1[&quot;Understand Intent&quot;]&#10;    BRAIN --&gt; B2[&quot;Reasoning &amp; Planning&quot;]&#10;    BRAIN --&gt; B3[&quot;Generate Response&quot;]&#10;&#10;    TOOLS --&gt; T1[&quot;File Read/Write&quot;]&#10;    TOOLS --&gt; T2[&quot;Code Execution&quot;]&#10;    TOOLS --&gt; T3[&quot;Search &amp; Retrieval&quot;]&#10;&#10;    MEMORY --&gt; M1[&quot;Short-term Memory&lt;br/&gt;Current Session Context&quot;]&#10;    MEMORY --&gt; M2[&quot;Long-term Memory&lt;br/&gt;Cross-session Knowledge&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    AGENT[\"AI Agent\"]\n    AGENT --&gt; BRAIN[\"🧠 Brain&lt;br/&gt;LLM Reasoning Engine\"]\n    AGENT --&gt; TOOLS[\"🔧 Tools&lt;br/&gt;Interact with External World\"]\n    AGENT --&gt; MEMORY[\"💾 Memory&lt;br/&gt;Context &amp; State\"]\n\n    BRAIN --&gt; B1[\"Understand Intent\"]\n    BRAIN --&gt; B2[\"Reasoning &amp; Planning\"]\n    BRAIN --&gt; B3[\"Generate Response\"]\n\n    TOOLS --&gt; T1[\"File Read/Write\"]\n    TOOLS --&gt; T2[\"Code Execution\"]\n    TOOLS --&gt; T3[\"Search &amp; Retrieval\"]\n\n    MEMORY --&gt; M1[\"Short-term Memory&lt;br/&gt;Current Session Context\"]\n    MEMORY --&gt; M2[\"Long-term Memory&lt;br/&gt;Cross-session Knowledge\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>在 AI 编程中的体现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大脑（Brain）</td>\n<td>核心推理引擎，理解意图、规划步骤、生成代码</td>\n<td>GPT-4、Claude、DeepSeek 等 LLM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具（Tools）</td>\n<td>与外部环境交互的能力</td>\n<td>文件读写、终端执行、代码搜索、Web 搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆（Memory）</td>\n<td>维持上下文状态，支撑多轮推理</td>\n<td>对话历史、项目规则、代码库索引</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"agent-vs-chatbot-vs-copilot\">Agent vs Chatbot vs Copilot</h3><p>这三者常被混淆，但它们在自主性和能力边界上有本质区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Chatbot</th>\n<th>Copilot</th>\n<th>Agent</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交互模式</td>\n<td>问答式，一问一答</td>\n<td>嵌入式，实时建议</td>\n<td>自主式，多步执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自主性</td>\n<td>无，完全由用户驱动</td>\n<td>低，跟随用户光标</td>\n<td>高，自主规划和执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具使用</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有限（补全上下文）</td>\n<td>丰富（文件、终端、搜索等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多步任务</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持，自动分解和迭代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型产品</td>\n<td>ChatGPT 网页版</td>\n<td>GitHub Copilot 补全</td>\n<td>Trae Agent、Claude Code</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 现代 AI 编程工具正在从 Copilot 模式向 Agent 模式演进。Copilot 负责&quot;辅助&quot;，Agent 负责&quot;执行&quot;。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h2><p>一个 Agent 从接收用户指令到完成任务，经历完整的生命周期：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as User&#10;    participant A as Agent&#10;    participant LLM as LLM Reasoning Engine&#10;    participant T as Tool Set&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;A: Submit task instruction&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;LLM: Send context + instruction&#10;    LLM--&gt;&gt;A: Return plan (need to search codebase)&#10;&#10;    loop Execution loop&#10;        A-&gt;&gt;T: Call tool (e.g., search code)&#10;        T--&gt;&gt;A: Return tool result&#10;        A-&gt;&gt;LLM: Send tool result + history context&#10;        LLM--&gt;&gt;A: Return next action or final result&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    A--&gt;&gt;U: Return execution results\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as User\n    participant A as Agent\n    participant LLM as LLM Reasoning Engine\n    participant T as Tool Set\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;A: Submit task instruction\n    A-&gt;&gt;LLM: Send context + instruction\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;A: Return plan (need to search codebase)\n\n    loop Execution loop\n        A-&gt;&gt;T: Call tool (e.g., search code)\n        T--&gt;&gt;A: Return tool result\n        A-&gt;&gt;LLM: Send tool result + history context\n        LLM--&gt;&gt;A: Return next action or final result\n    end\n\n    A--&gt;&gt;U: Return execution results</pre><p>Agent 生命周期可以分为四个阶段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>关键活动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始化（Init）</td>\n<td>加载配置、建立上下文</td>\n<td>读取项目规则、加载记忆、初始化工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规划（Plan）</td>\n<td>分析任务，制定执行策略</td>\n<td>意图识别、任务分解、步骤排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行（Execute）</td>\n<td>逐步执行计划</td>\n<td>工具调用、代码生成、结果验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终止（Terminate）</td>\n<td>汇总结果，清理状态</td>\n<td>结果汇报、记忆持久化、资源释放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心组件\">核心组件</h2><p>单 Agent 架构内部由四个核心组件协同工作：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    INPUT[&quot;User Instruction&quot;] --&gt; PLANNER&#10;&#10;    subgraph Agent Internal Architecture&#10;        PLANNER[&quot;📋 Planner&quot;]&#10;        EXECUTOR[&quot;⚡ Executor&quot;]&#10;        MM[&quot;💾 Memory Manager&quot;]&#10;        TC[&quot;🔧 Tool Controller&quot;]&#10;&#10;        PLANNER --&gt;|&quot;Execution plan&quot;| EXECUTOR&#10;        EXECUTOR --&gt;|&quot;Call tool&quot;| TC&#10;        TC --&gt;|&quot;Return Result&quot;| EXECUTOR&#10;        EXECUTOR --&gt;|&quot;Update state&quot;| MM&#10;        MM --&gt;|&quot;Provide context&quot;| PLANNER&#10;        EXECUTOR --&gt;|&quot;Report progress&quot;| PLANNER&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    EXECUTOR --&gt; OUTPUT[&quot;Execution Result&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    INPUT[\"User Instruction\"] --&gt; PLANNER\n\n    subgraph Agent Internal Architecture\n        PLANNER[\"📋 Planner\"]\n        EXECUTOR[\"⚡ Executor\"]\n        MM[\"💾 Memory Manager\"]\n        TC[\"🔧 Tool Controller\"]\n\n        PLANNER --&gt;|\"Execution plan\"| EXECUTOR\n        EXECUTOR --&gt;|\"Call tool\"| TC\n        TC --&gt;|\"Return Result\"| EXECUTOR\n        EXECUTOR --&gt;|\"Update state\"| MM\n        MM --&gt;|\"Provide context\"| PLANNER\n        EXECUTOR --&gt;|\"Report progress\"| PLANNER\n    end\n\n    EXECUTOR --&gt; OUTPUT[\"Execution Result\"]</pre><h3 id=\"规划器-planner\">规划器（Planner）</h3><p>规划器负责理解用户意图并将复杂任务分解为可执行的步骤序列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TaskPlan {&#10;  goal: string;&#10;  steps: PlanStep[];&#10;  currentStepIndex: number;&#10;  status: &#39;planning&#39; | &#39;executing&#39; | &#39;completed&#39; | &#39;failed&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface PlanStep {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  description: string;&#10;  toolCalls: ToolCall[];&#10;  dependencies: string[];&#10;  status: &#39;pending&#39; | &#39;in_progress&#39; | &#39;completed&#39; | &#39;failed&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TaskPlan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  goal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PlanStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currentStepIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'planning'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'executing'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PlanStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  toolCalls</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolCall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dependencies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_progress'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"执行器-executor\">执行器（Executor）</h3><p>执行器按照规划器生成的计划逐步执行，处理工具调用结果并决定是否需要重新规划：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ExecutionResult {&#10;  stepId: string;&#10;  success: boolean;&#10;  output: string;&#10;  toolCallResults: ToolCallResult[];&#10;  needsReplan: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function executeStep(step: PlanStep, context: AgentContext): Promise&lt;ExecutionResult&gt; {&#10;  const toolResults: ToolCallResult[] = [];&#10;&#10;  for (const toolCall of step.toolCalls) {&#10;    const result = await context.toolController.execute(toolCall);&#10;    toolResults.push(result);&#10;&#10;    if (!result.success) {&#10;      return {&#10;        stepId: step.id,&#10;        success: false,&#10;        output: result.error,&#10;        toolCallResults: toolResults,&#10;        needsReplan: true,&#10;      };&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    stepId: step.id,&#10;    success: true,&#10;    output: summarizeResults(toolResults),&#10;    toolCallResults: toolResults,&#10;    needsReplan: false,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExecutionResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  stepId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  success</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  toolCallResults</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolCallResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  needsReplan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> executeStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PlanStep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AgentContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ExecutionResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> toolResults</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolCallResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> toolCall</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step.toolCalls) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49