><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  parameters</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JSONSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  requiresApproval</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  execute</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ToolCallResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"优缺点分析\">优缺点分析</h2><h3 id=\"agent-状态管理\">Agent 状态管理</h3><p>Agent 在执行过程中需要维护一个复杂的状态机：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    IDLE[&quot;Idle&lt;br/&gt;IDLE&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Receive Task&quot;| PLANNING[&quot;Planning&lt;br/&gt;PLANNING&quot;]&#10;    PLANNING --&gt;|&quot;Plan complete&quot;| EXECUTING[&quot;Executing&lt;br/&gt;EXECUTING&quot;]&#10;    EXECUTING --&gt;|&quot;Needs replan&quot;| PLANNING&#10;    EXECUTING --&gt;|&quot;Wait for user confirmation&quot;| WAITING[&quot;Waiting&lt;br/&gt;WAITING&quot;]&#10;    WAITING --&gt;|&quot;User confirms&quot;| EXECUTING&#10;    WAITING --&gt;|&quot;User cancels&quot;| IDLE&#10;    EXECUTING --&gt;|&quot;Task complete&quot;| COMPLETED[&quot;Completed&lt;br/&gt;COMPLETED&quot;]&#10;    EXECUTING --&gt;|&quot;Unrecoverable error&quot;| FAILED[&quot;Failed&lt;br/&gt;FAILED&quot;]&#10;    COMPLETED --&gt;|&quot;New Task&quot;| IDLE&#10;    FAILED --&gt;|&quot;Retry&quot;| PLANNING\">flowchart LR\n    IDLE[\"Idle&lt;br/&gt;IDLE\"] --&gt;|\"Receive Task\"| PLANNING[\"Planning&lt;br/&gt;PLANNING\"]\n    PLANNING --&gt;|\"Plan complete\"| EXECUTING[\"Executing&lt;br/&gt;EXECUTING\"]\n    EXECUTING --&gt;|\"Needs replan\"| PLANNING\n    EXECUTING --&gt;|\"Wait for user confirmation\"| WAITING[\"Waiting&lt;br/&gt;WAITING\"]\n    WAITING --&gt;|\"User confirms\"| EXECUTING\n    WAITING --&gt;|\"User cancels\"| IDLE\n    EXECUTING --&gt;|\"Task complete\"| COMPLETED[\"Completed&lt;br/&gt;COMPLETED\"]\n    EXECUTING --&gt;|\"Unrecoverable error\"| FAILED[\"Failed&lt;br/&gt;FAILED\"]\n    COMPLETED --&gt;|\"New Task\"| IDLE\n    FAILED --&gt;|\"Retry\"| PLANNING</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>能处理复杂多步任务</td>\n<td>Token 消耗大，成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自主规划，减少人工介入</td>\n<td>推理延迟较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可使用多种工具扩展能力</td>\n<td>可能产生幻觉导致错误操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>具备错误恢复和重规划能力</td>\n<td>难以调试和复现问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能利用上下文持续迭代</td>\n<td>安全风险——自主操作文件和终端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 AI 编程场景中，Agent 的安全边界尤为重要。大多数工具会在执行文件写入或终端命令前要求用户确认，这是&quot;人在回路&quot;（Human-in-the-Loop）模式的体现。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"变体与演进\">变体与演进</h2><p>Agent 架构在实际工具中呈现出多种变体：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变体</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>代表工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>对话式 Agent</td>\n<td>单轮推理为主，工具调用简单</td>\n<td>ChatGPT with Plugins</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编码 Agent</td>\n<td>深度集成 IDE，具备文件和终端操作能力</td>\n<td>Trae、Cursor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终端 Agent</td>\n<td>在命令行中运行，以终端为主要交互界面</td>\n<td>Claude Code、Aider</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自主 Agent</td>\n<td>高度自主，可长时间独立运行</td>\n<td>Devin、OpenHands</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Increasing Autonomy&#10;        direction LR&#10;        V1[&quot;Conversational Agent&lt;br/&gt;Low Autonomy&quot;] --&gt; V2[&quot;Coding Agent&lt;br/&gt;Medium Autonomy&quot;] --&gt; V3[&quot;Terminal Agent&lt;br/&gt;Higher Autonomy&quot;] --&gt; V4[&quot;Autonomous Agent&lt;br/&gt;High Autonomy&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Increasing Autonomy\n        direction LR\n        V1[\"Conversational Agent&lt;br/&gt;Low Autonomy\"] --&gt; V2[\"Coding Agent&lt;br/&gt;Medium Autonomy\"] --&gt; V3[\"Terminal Agent&lt;br/&gt;Higher Autonomy\"] --&gt; V4[\"Autonomous Agent&lt;br/&gt;High Autonomy\"]\n    end</pre><p>Agent 架构的演进方向包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多模态感知</strong>：从纯文本扩展到理解截图、UI 布局、终端输出等</li>\n<li><strong>工具生态扩展</strong>：通过 MCP（Model Context Protocol）等协议标准化工具接入</li>\n<li><strong>分层自治</strong>：区分需要确认的危险操作和可自动执行的安全操作</li>\n<li><strong>记忆系统增强</strong>：从简单对话历史到向量检索 + 知识图谱的混合记忆</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>AI Agent 是以 LLM 为大脑、工具为双手、记忆为经验的自主智能体。它通过&quot;规划-执行-观察&quot;的循环来完成复杂任务，内部由规划器、执行器、记忆管理器和工具控制器四大组件协同运作。与传统的 Chatbot 和 Copilot 相比，Agent 具备更高的自主性和更强的任务完成能力，但也带来了成本、延迟和安全方面的挑战。理解 Agent 的核心概念和架构，是深入学习后续多智能体协作、ReAct 模式和规划反思机制的基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Agent 核心概念","id":"agent-核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模式定义","id":"模式定义"},{"level":3,"text":"Agent vs Chatbot vs Copilot","id":"agent-vs-chatbot-vs-copilot"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流程","id":"工作流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心组件","id":"核心组件"},{"level":3,"text":"规划器（Planner）","id":"规划器-planner"},{"level":3,"text":"执行器（Executor）","id":"执行器-executor"},{"level":3,"text":"记忆管理器（Memory Manager）","id":"记忆管理器-memory-manager"},{"level":3,"text":"工具控制器（Tool Controller）","id":"工具控制器-tool-controller"},{"level":2,"text":"优缺点分析","id":"优缺点分析"},{"level":3,"text":"Agent 状态管理","id":"agent-状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"变体与演进","id":"变体与演进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"提示工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/foundations/prompt-engineering"},"next":{"title":"SubAgent 与多智能体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/agent-patterns/subagent-and-multi-agent"}}